  "description": {
   "value": "<p>Pool of healing = 5 × your level × your CE modifier (the uses of this item). As a bonus action spend CE up to your CE modifier: each CE heals 10 HP and removes 10 from the pool. Refills on a long rest; recovers 10 every two rounds (adjust by hand). See the rules journal, <em>Breakthroughs</em>.</p><p><em>Choose the CE in the scaling field; CE and pool are deducted automatically.</em></p>"
  },
